OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fvery warm evening with plenty of late
OL,7,Fsunshine. Remaining dry overnight with
OL,8,Fplenty of clear spells. Remaining warm
OL,9,Fmaking it rather uncomfortable for
OL,10,Fsleeping.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FAnother largely sunny and dry
OL,13,Fday for most, although a risk of a few
OL,14,Fshowers developing later in the day
OL,15,Facross the east. A little cooler but
OL,16,Fstill feeling hot.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
